# PRC Block Library Doc Sync

When changing a block under `plugins/prc-block-library/src/<block-slug>/`, also update the matching doc file:

- `docs/plugins/prc-block-library/blocks/<block-slug>.md`

Update docs whenever code changes affect behavior, UI, data flow, Interactivity API state/actions, attributes, supports, rendering, setup, or usage examples.

If a docs file does not exist for a changed block slug, create one using the existing docs format under `docs/plugins/prc-block-library/blocks/`.
